#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tastatura za Android"

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid ""
"Swajp – swipe keyboard for Android, no internet access, offline dictation."
msgstr ""
"Swajp – tastatura za kucanje prevlačenjem za Android, bez pristupa internetu, oflajn diktiranje."

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Light / dark mode"
msgstr "Svetli / tamni režim"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Početna"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Jezici"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privatnost"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Licence"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tastatura"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tastatura<br><em>dostojna cara.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Brza kao Anax – carski vilin konjic.<br>Precizna kao njegov lov."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nadahnuta Swypeom. Rođena kao Swajp.</strong> Tastatura za Android na kojoj kucaš klizanjem prsta. Reči pogađa iz konteksta, uči tvoj stil, a svi tvoji podaci ostaju na telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Nabavite na Google Play"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Jezički paketi"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Kucanje prevlačenjem"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Prevuci prstom preko slova i reč se pojavi."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Predviđanje reči"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Predlaže sledeću reč prema onome što kucaš."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Pokreti i uređivanje teksta"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Kopiraj, nalepi, opozovi i izaberi jednim prevlačenjem."

#: index
msgid "Themes &amp; colours"
msgstr "Teme i boje"

#: index
msgid "Six themes or colours of your own."
msgstr "Šest tema ili sopstvene boje."

#: index
msgid "Size &amp; layout"
msgstr "Veličina i raspored"

#: index
msgid "Split, one-handed or floating."
msgstr "Podeljena, za jednu ruku ili plutajuća."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Numerička tastatura i kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Velike cifre, kalkulator i naučni kalkulator."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emodžiji"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Otkucaj reč i emodži doleti."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dva jezika odjednom, ukupno 35."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Oflajn diktiranje"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Govor u tekst direktno na telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Istorija privremene memorije"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "Poslednjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvek pri ruci."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Rezervna kopija"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Prenesi naučene reči na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Bez interneta, bez reklama, bez praćenja."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prethodno"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Sledeće"

#: index
msgid "Another word from the bar"
msgstr "Druga reč iz trake"

#: index
msgid "Capital letter"
msgstr "Veliko slovo"

#: index
msgid "Character from the key corner"
msgstr "Znak iz ugla tastera"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Jedri po tasterima kao vilin konjic."

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate. Words with a similar swipe wait in the suggestion bar – one tap swaps them. For a capital letter, slide from the first letter up above the keyboard and straight on to the next one. A swipe from a letter to the space bar types the character from its corner, such as ? or !"
msgstr ""
"Ne moraš da kucaš slovo po slovo – dovoljno je jedno prevlačenje preko slova reči. Swajp prepoznaje prevlačenje i kad nije savršeno i uči tvoj stil, pa je sve precizniji. Reči sa sličnim prevlačenjem čekaju na traci predloga – jednim dodirom ih zameniš. Za veliko slovo sa prvog slova kreni nagore iznad tastature i odatle pravo na sledeće. Prevlačenje sa slova na razmaknicu upisuje znak iz njegovog ugla, na primer ? ili !"

#: index
msgid "Next word suggestion"
msgstr "Predlog sledeće reči"

#: index
msgid "Fixing a typo"
msgstr "Ispravka slovne greške"

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr ""
"Predviđa tvoju sledeću reč kao što vilin konjic predviđa let svog plena."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next – after a space, just tap it. It uses context to tell similar words apart and learns the words you actually use. When you tap out a word with a typo, the bar shows what you typed next to the fix, and the space bar inserts the highlighted fix."
msgstr ""
"Na osnovu prethodnih reči predlaže šta ćeš verovatno sledeće otkucati – posle razmaka samo dodirni. Iz konteksta razlikuje slične reči i uči reči koje zaista koristiš. Kad pri kucanju pogrešiš, traka prikazuje otkucano pored ispravke, a razmaknica umeće istaknutu ispravku."

#: index
msgid "Copy and paste"
msgstr "Kopiraj i nalepi"

#: index
msgid "Undo and redo"
msgstr "Opozovi i ponovi"

#: index
msgid "Select all and deselect"
msgstr "Izaberi sve i poništi izbor"

#: index
msgid "UPPER / lower case"
msgstr "VELIKA / mala slova"

#: index
msgid "Deleting words and lines"
msgstr "Brisanje reči i redova"

#: index
msgid "Moving the cursor"
msgstr "Pomeranje kursora"

#: index
msgid "Text editing – the [I] key"
msgstr "Uređivanje teksta – taster [I]"

#: index
msgid "Selecting several lines"
msgstr "Označavanje više redova"

#: index
msgid "Start and end"
msgstr "Početak i kraj"

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Vlada vazduhom. Sada vlada i tvojim tekstom."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – Enter → space undoes, Swajp → space redoes, up to 60 steps. Copy, paste, cut or select all with a swipe from the Swajp key to C, V, X or A, and change case with a single gesture. Slide left from ⌫ to delete whole words, or up for whole lines. Double-tap the space bar and slide to move the cursor as precisely as landing on a reed. The [I] key opens editing with arrows, selection, Start and End."
msgstr ""
"Leti i unazad i unapred – Enter → razmaknica opoziva, Swajp → razmaknica ponavlja, do 60 koraka. Kopiraj, nalepi, iseci ili izaberi sve prevlačenjem sa tastera Swajp na C, V, X ili A, a veličinu slova menjaš jednim pokretom. Prevlačenjem sa ⌫ ulevo brišeš cele reči, nagore cele redove. Dvaput dodirni razmaknicu i prevuci – kursor pomeraš precizno kao vilin konjic kad sleće na trsku. Taster [I] otvara uređivanje sa strelicama, izborom, Početkom i Krajem."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Svi pokreti s prikazima i vežbanjem nalaze se u aplikaciji: Podešavanja → Pokreti i vodič."

#: index
msgid "Light green"
msgstr "Svetlozelena"

#: index
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svetla"

#: index
msgid "AMOLED black"
msgstr "AMOLED crna"

#: index
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Plava"

#: index
msgid "Orange"
msgstr "Narandžasta"

#: index
msgid "Purple"
msgstr "Ljubičasta"

#: index
msgid "Admire its many shimmering colours."
msgstr "Divi se njenim brojnim svetlucavim bojama."

#: index
msgid ""
"Pick a ready-made theme or set your own colours for the highlight, keys, special keys, background and text. You can also adjust the font size in the suggestion bar, vibration and key sounds."
msgstr ""
"Izaberi gotovu temu ili podesi sopstvene boje za isticanje, tastere, posebne tastere, pozadinu i tekst. Možeš da podesiš i veličinu slova na traci predloga, vibraciju i zvuke tastera."

#: index
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Cela"

#: index
msgid "Taller"
msgstr "Viša"

#: index
msgid "Smaller and lifted"
msgstr "Manja i podignuta"

#: index
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

#: index
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Plutajuća"

#: index
msgid "Spread your wings, or fold them out of the way."
msgstr "Raširi krila ili ih sklopi da ne smetaju."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick Size: drag the handles to change the height, width and position. Make it taller, or smaller and lifted off the bottom edge, split it into two halves for both thumbs (Tablet), move it to the edge for one hand, or let it float freely above apps. In landscape the keyboard is lower and split."
msgstr ""
"Drži taster Swajp i izaberi Veličinu: prevlačenjem ručica menjaš visinu, širinu i položaj. Učini je višom ili manjom i podignutom od donje ivice, podeli je na dve polovine za oba palca (Tablet), pomeri je uz ivicu za jednu ruku ili je pusti da slobodno pluta iznad aplikacija. U horizontalnom položaju tastatura je niža i podeljena."

#: index
msgid "Number pad"
msgstr "Numerička tastatura"

#: index
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Percent and brackets"
msgstr "Procenat i zagrade"

#: index
msgid "Scientific calculator"
msgstr "Naučni kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "I bistroj glavi dobro dođe kalkulator."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the [I] key for the number pad: big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. The calculator counts right in the suggestion bar and inserts the result into the text. It handles percent (200 + 10 % = 220) and brackets, and the scientific mode adds functions, powers, degrees and radians – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Drži taster [I] za numeričku tastaturu: velike cifre za brz unos brojeva telefona i iznosa. Kalkulator računa direktno na traci predloga i umeće rezultat u tekst. Zna procente (200 + 10% = 220) i zagrade, a naučni režim dodaje funkcije, potencije, stepene i radijane – bez prebacivanja aplikacija."

#: index
msgid "Emoji from a word"
msgstr "Emodži iz reči"

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Uhvati emociju u letu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"Otkucaj reč prevlačenjem ili dodirom – npr. „heart“, „beer“ ili „sad“ – i Swajp ti u traci s predlozima ponudi emodži. Radi i prečica :), a možeš ga i jednostavno izabrati sa spiska."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once"
msgstr "Dva jezika odjednom"

#: index
msgid "A new word for the dictionary"
msgstr "Nova reč za rečnik"

#: index
msgid "Hindi"
msgstr "Hindi"

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Rođena da vlada – na 35 jezika."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. Tap an unknown word in the bar to add it to the dictionary of one language or both. In Hindi you type in Latin letters (Hinglish) and get Devanagari – or stay with Latin. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Kucaj na dva jezika bez prebacivanja – tastatura zna reči iz oba. Dodirom nepoznate reči na traci dodaješ je u rečnik jednog ili oba jezika. Na hindiju kucaš latinicom (Hinglish) i dobijaš devanagari – ili ostaješ na latinici. 9 jezika je ugrađeno (engleski u dve varijante), još 26 možeš da preuzmeš kao pakete."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Zelenom bojom</span> označeni jezici su ugrađeni, ostali mogu da se <a href=\"languages.html\">preuzmu kao paketi</a>."

#: index
msgid "Dictation"
msgstr "Diktiranje"

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Čuje te. Nikome ne govori."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold the Swajp key and pick the microphone – the text appears as you speak. Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Drži taster Swajp i izaberi mikrofon – tekst se kuca dok govoriš. Govor se pretvara u tekst direktno na telefonu (modeli Parakeet i Omnilingual), bez interneta. Ako želiš, umesto toga možeš da koristiš prepoznavanje govora Google. Prepoznate reči se proveravaju prema rečniku."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Pamti šta kopiraš. Tajne zaboravlja."

#: index
msgid ""
"Hold Enter and pick the clipboard: your last 30 copied texts are always at hand – tap to paste, pin the ones you want to keep. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"Drži Enter i izaberi privremenu memoriju: poslednjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvek ti je pri ruci – dodirom ih nalepiš, a one koje želiš da zadržiš zakačiš. Lozinke, kodovi i tekst označen kao osetljiv nikad se ne čuvaju, a istorija se sama briše posle vremena koje izabereš."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Vilin konjic može da preleti more. Tvoje naučene reči i stil kucanja mogu da prelete na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Podešavanja, tvoje reči i sve što je Swajp naučio iz tvog kucanja čuvaju se u jednoj datoteci – učitaj je na novom telefonu i Swajp odmah kuca kao tvoj. Datoteka ostaje kod tebe: ništa ne ide preko interneta ni u oblak."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Ti si lovac, nikad plen."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nimalo praćenja, maksimum privatnosti. </strong>Swajp nema dozvolu za pristup internetu. Ništa što otkucaš ili oflajn izdiktiraš ne može da napusti tvoj telefon. Bez reklama, bez analitike. U poljima za lozinke ništa se ne uči niti čuva."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Politika privatnosti →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Kažu da kad na tebe sleti vilin konjic, u tvoj život stiže promena.</span>Neka ovaj sleti na vrhove tvojih prstiju."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – jezički paketi"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Jezici koji nisu ugrađeni u aplikaciju mogu da se dodaju kao paket. To je obična zip datoteka s rečnikom – ništa se ne instalira i aplikaciji za to ne treba internet."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Kako dodati paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Preuzmi zip željenog jezika. Sačuvaće se u folderu Preuzimanja."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Otvori <b>Swajp → Podešavanja → Jezici → Dodatni jezici (paketi)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Dodirni <b>Uvezi jezičke pakete (jedan ili više)</b> i izaberi preuzetu datoteku."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Izaberi novi jezik kao glavni ili drugi jezik."

